OL,3,GNEWSAMan who tried to take fishing boat
OL,4,Ato sea jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who took a fishing boat and tried
OL,7,Fto take it out to sea, causing more
OL,8,Fthan #5,000 worth of damage, has been
OL,9,Fjailed for eight months.
OL,11,FBilal Adam, 30, took the boat from
OL,12,FRoyal Harbour in Ramsgate at about
OL,13,F03:15 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe Sudanese national, who lived in
OL,16,FManchester, pleaded guilty to
OL,17,Faggravated vehicle taking and damaging
OL,18,Fa vehicle, and was sentenced at Margate
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,21,FHe was also disqualified from driving
OL,22,Ffor one year and 121 days.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
